{start_of_chorus}
[*Everybody] Swing [G]low, sweet [C]chari[G]ot
Coming for to carry me [D]home
Swing [G]low, sweet [C]chari[G]ot
Coming for to [D7]carry me [G]home
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
I [G]looked over Jordan and [C]what did I [G]see
Coming for to carry me [D]home
A [G]band of angels [C]coming after [G]me
Coming for to [D7]carry me [G]home
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
If [G]you get there be[C]fore I [G]do
Coming for to carry me [D]home
Tell [G]all my friends I'm [C]coming too
Coming for to [D7]carry me [G]home
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
I'm [G]sometimes up and [C]sometimes [G]down
Coming for to carry me [D]home
